{"overview":"ماهیتو یک پسر نوجوان است که تلاش می کند با مرگ مادرش کنار بیاید، اما پس از اینکه یک پرنده جادویی به او می گوید که مادرش هنوز زنده است، ماهیتو وارد دنیایی اسرارآمیز و پنهانی می شود و...","tagline":"","overview_en":"While the Second World War rages, the teenage Mahito, haunted by his mother's tragic death, is relocated from Tokyo to the serene rural home of his new stepmother Natsuko, a woman who bears a striking resemblance to the boy's mother.  As he tries to adjust, this strange new world grows even stranger following the appearance of a persistent gray heron, who perplexes and bedevils Mahito, dubbing him the \"long-awaited one.\"","tagline_en":"Where death comes to an end, life finds a new beginning.","runtime":124,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["هایائو میازاکی"],"crew_en":["Hayao Miyazaki"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"山時聡真","role":"Mahito Maki (voice)","photo":"/g4I9g3IRcbxqTqDuOtgG9QicvfB.jpg","en":"Soma Santoki"},{"name":"ماساکی سودا","role":"Gray Heron (voice)","photo":"/g7gXu0bE9jZ5LHjSqn1zHdNtiA1.jpg","en":"Masaki Suda"},{"name":"柴咲コウ","role":"Kiriko (voice)","photo":"/eEBNceN1MsDFibWVV3VIcEHygUW.jpg","en":"Ko Shibasaki"},{"name":"あいみょん","role":"Lady Himi (voice)","photo":"/4pFkEwuyqADASOX205qZhLl4hfF.jpg","en":"Aimyon"},{"name":"木村佳乃","role":"Natsuko (voice)","photo":"/fI0ALURUC3CO96fEb33f4iijlF.jpg","en":"Yoshino Kimura"},{"name":"木村拓哉","role":"Shoichi Maki (voice)","photo":"/sswCg8kvFsgSaVJwcIKKe4K7jOe.jpg","en":"Takuya Kimura"},{"name":"竹下景子","role":"Izumi (voice)","photo":"/jmXWhUM4IhvyMrRkzYnDQamkqjG.jpg","en":"Keiko Takeshita"},{"name":"風吹ジュン","role":"Utako (voice)","photo":"/uHF9NdKrG1bN7GwZB7PI21Rkdv8.jpg","en":"Jun Fubuki"},{"name":"阿川佐和子","role":"Eriko (voice)","photo":"/erf8kZxEitlpiOOcyFWqBNjbOjX.jpg","en":"Sawako Agawa"},{"name":"滝沢カレン","role":"Warawara (voice)","photo":"/5jqe7vYpvVxN2EF1PAx2C2ZyThr.jpg","en":"Karen Takizawa"},{"name":"大竹しのぶ","role":"Aiko (voice)","photo":"/az5hCPy37MFM9EH2f3gn1cT